Subject: [PATCH] vpu: queue only completed JPEG buffers to USB

Hand encoded packets to the event loop through an eventfd, retain borrowed
sink buffers until a packet is available, and prime both output buffers with
real JPEGs before starting USB. Bound startup with a timerfd and unwind partial
starts on failure or shutdown. Initialize hardware in the worker, use bounded
nonblocking capture waits, and keep packet/thread ownership across restarts.
If the vendor encoder cannot stop, exit before releasing worker-owned memory
so the camera supervisor can restart the process.

